#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:2
msgid "创建您的第一个工作流"
msgstr "Create your first workflow"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:4
msgid ""
"本节将带您在 DaoAI 天眼平台中，从零开始创建并运行您的第一个工作流。 通过一个完整示例，您将了解如何在可视化界面中连接各个功能模块， "
"并运行一条从数据输入到模型推理再到业务输出的完整 AI 视觉流程。"
msgstr ""
"This section will take you through creating and running your first "
"workflow from scratch in the DaoAI Tianyan platform.Through a complete "
"example, you will learn how to connect various functional modules in the "
"visual interface and run a complete AI visual process from data input to "
"model inference to business output."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:14
msgid "前提条件"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:16
msgid "在开始之前，请确保已完成以下准备工作："
msgstr "Before you begin, make sure you have completed the following preparations:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:18
msgid "已成功登录 DaoAI 天眼平台。"
msgstr "Successfully logged into DaoAI Tianyan platform."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:19
msgid "已准备好可用于推理的模型（目标检测 / 分类 / 分割模型，可为平台内置或自训练模型）。"
msgstr ""
"Models are ready for inference (object "
"detection/classification/segmentation models, either built-in or self-"
"trained for the platform)."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:20
msgid "已准备好至少一组测试数据，例如单张图片、本地文件夹、视频文件或 RTSP 摄像头流。"
msgstr ""
"At least one set of test data is ready, such as a single image, a local "
"folder, a video file, or an RTSP camera stream."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:24
msgid "步骤 1：创建新工作流"
msgstr "Step 1: Create a new workflow"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:26
msgid "打开 DaoAI 天眼平台 ``http://<your_server_ip>:38080/dashboard`` 。"
msgstr "Open DaoAI Tianyan platform ``http://<your_server_ip>:38080/dashboard``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:27
msgid "在上方导航栏中点击 **“工作流 (Workflows)”**。"
msgstr "Click **\"Workflows\"** in the upper navigation bar."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:28
msgid "进入工作流管理页面后，点击 **“创建工作流”**，系统将进入工作流编辑画布界面。。"
msgstr ""
"After entering the workflow management page, click **\"Create "
"Workflow\"**, and the system will enter the workflow editing canvas "
"interface. ."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:29
msgid "输入工作流名称，例如 ``新工作流``。"
msgstr "Enter a workflow name, such as ``New Workflow``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:30
msgid "点击保存。"
msgstr "Click Save."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:34
msgid "DaoAI 天眼工作流概览"
msgstr "DaoAI Tianyan workflow overview"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:40
msgid "DaoAI Video Analysis Platform workflow overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:46
msgid "步骤 2：添加模型推理模块"
msgstr "Step 2: Add the model inference module"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:48
msgid "点击添加模型，添加一个 **模型推理模块**："
msgstr "Click Add Model to add a **Model Inference Module**:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:50
msgid "可以选择： - DaoAI World 模型， 选择一个从DaoAI World 训练并导出的模型："
msgstr ""
"You can choose: - DaoAI World model, choose a model trained and exported "
"from DaoAI World:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:53
msgid "目标检测模型模块（Object Detection）"
msgstr "Object Detection Model Module (Object Detection)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:54
msgid "分类模型模块（Classification）"
msgstr "Classification model module (Classification)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:55
msgid "视力分割模型模块（Instance Segmentation）"
msgstr "Vision segmentation model module (Instance Segmentation)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:56
msgid "关键点检测模型模块（Keypoint Detection）"
msgstr "Keypoint detection model module (Keypoint Detection)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:57
msgid "语义分割模型模块（Segmentation）"
msgstr "Semantic segmentation model module (Segmentation)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:58
msgid "混合模型模块（Mixed Model）"
msgstr "Mixed Model"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:59
msgid "OCR 模型模块（OCR Model）"
msgstr "OCR Model module"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:61
msgid "通用检测模型模块（General Detection）"
msgstr "General detection model module (General Detection)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:63
msgid ""
"本示例中，我们选择 **通用检测模型（General Detection）** 模块进行演示。 该模型支持使用英文自然语言描述目标类别， "
"系统将基于智能多模态模型自动完成目标识别与定位。"
msgstr ""
"In this example, we select the **General Detection** module for "
"demonstration. The model supports the use of English natural language to "
"describe target categories, and the system will automatically complete "
"target recognition and positioning based on the intelligent multi-modal "
"model."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:67
#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:73
msgid "Add Model in Workflow"
msgstr "Add Model in Workflow"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:71
msgid "添加后，配置模型的标签，使用英文自然语言输入需要识别的目标类别，例如 ``person`` 、 ``car`` 、 ``truck`` 等。"
msgstr ""
"After adding, configure the label of the model and use English natural "
"language to enter the target category to be recognized, such as "
"``person``, ``car``, ``truck``, etc."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:77
msgid "模型模块将在工作流运行时对视频流的每帧图像数据进行实时推理，并输出预测结果。"
msgstr ""
"The model module will perform real-time inference on each frame of image "
"data of the video stream when the workflow is running, and output "
"prediction results."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:80
msgid "步骤 3：添加业务逻辑与可视化模块"
msgstr "Step 3: Add business logic and visualization modules"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:82
msgid "根据业务需求，添加 **逻辑/规则模块**，例如："
msgstr "According to business needs, add **logic/rule module**, for example:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:84
msgid "检测过滤模块: 按照标签，置信度，等条件过滤检测结果；这里我们设置过滤person标签；"
msgstr ""
"Detection filtering module: Filter detection results according to tags, "
"confidence, and other conditions; here we set the filtering person tag;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:85
msgid "Filter Module"
msgstr "Filter Module"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:89
msgid "条件判断模块: 根据配置的条件语句进行判断，并触发对应的分支逻辑；这里我们设置当检测到person数量大于5时触发报警；"
msgstr ""
"Conditional judgment module: judge based on the configured conditional "
"statement and trigger the corresponding branch logic; here we set an "
"alarm to be triggered when the number of persons detected is greater than"
" 5;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:90
msgid "Condition Module"
msgstr "Condition Module"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:94
msgid ""
"继续添加 **可视化模块**，用于在图像上叠加绘制检测结果，并在条件判断模块中将 ``下一步`` "
"参数配置为对应的可视化模块，使工作流在条件满足后继续执行该可视化节点"
msgstr ""
"Continue to add the **Visualization module**, which is used to overlay "
"and draw the detection results on the image, and configure the ``Next "
"step`` parameter in the conditional judgment module to the corresponding "
"visualization module, so that the workflow continues to execute the "
"visualization node after the conditions are met."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:96
msgid "边界框可视化模块： 在图像上绘制目标检测的边界框； ``预测显示`` 参数选择模型模块的输出结果；"
msgstr ""
"Bounding box visualization module: Draws the bounding box of the object "
"detection on the image; ``prediction display`` output result of the "
"parameter selection model module;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:97
msgid "标签可视化模块： 在图像上显示目标类别标签和置信度； ``预测显示`` 参数选择模型模块的输出结果；"
msgstr ""
"Label visualization module: displays the target category label and "
"confidence on the image; ``prediction display`` output results of the "
"parameter selection model module;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:98
msgid "仪表盘显示模块： 在监控大屏中显示可视化结果。"
msgstr ""
"Dashboard display module: Displays visual results on the large monitoring"
" screen."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:100
msgid "Visualization Module"
msgstr "Visualization Module"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:105
msgid "步骤 4：添加事件保存模块"
msgstr "Step 4: Add event saving module"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:107
msgid "根据业务需求，添加 **事件保存模块**，用于记录和存储检测到的事件。"
msgstr ""
"According to business needs, add **Event Saving Module** to record and "
"store detected events."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:109
msgid "输入事件类型"
msgstr "Enter event type"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:110
msgid "选择要展示的可视化输入，作为图片保存内容"
msgstr "Select the visual input to be displayed and save the content as an image"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:111
msgid "是否保存视频：选择保存视频时，系统会将事件发生的前后15秒的视频片段和事件一同保存。"
msgstr ""
"Whether to save the video: When you choose to save the video, the system "
"will save the 15 seconds of video clips before and after the event occurs"
" together with the event."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:112
msgid "最大视频时长：事件发生时，单个视频文件的最大时长，单位为秒，默认30秒，也就是事件发生前后15秒，总共30秒的视频片段。"
msgstr ""
"Maximum video duration: When an event occurs, the maximum duration of a "
"single video file, in seconds, defaults to 30 seconds, which is 15 "
"seconds before and after the event, for a total of 30 seconds of video "
"clips."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:120
msgid "步骤 5：保存并运行工作流"
msgstr "Step 5: Save and run the workflow"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:122
msgid "点击画布右上角的 **“保存”** 按钮保存工作流配置。"
msgstr ""
"Click the **Save** button in the upper right corner of the canvas to save"
" the workflow configuration."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:123
msgid "上传一张图片，点击 **“运行 / 测试”** 开始执行工作流："
msgstr ""
"Upload an image and click **\"Run/Test\"** to start executing the "
"workflow:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:124
msgid "运行完成后，您可以查看输出的json结果。以及可视化结果。"
msgstr ""
"After the run is completed, you can view the output json results.and "
"visualize the results."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:126
#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:129
msgid "Workflow Result"
msgstr "Workflow Result"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:134
msgid "示例：基础检测工作流"
msgstr "Example: Basic Detection Workflow"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:136
msgid "下面示例展示了一个最常见的工作流结构， 实现“目标检测 → 结果可视化 → 输出保存”的完整流程："
msgstr ""
"The following example shows one of the most common workflow structures, "
"realizing the complete process of \"target detection → result "
"visualization → output saving\":"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:168
msgid "运行工作流的多种方式"
msgstr "Multiple ways to run workflows"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:170
msgid "您的工作流现已保存至 DaoAI 天眼系统服务器。这意味着您可以通过多种方式运行它，包括："
msgstr ""
"Your workflow is now saved to the DaoAI Video Analysis Platform server.This means "
"you can run it in a variety of ways, including:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:172
msgid "在平台中完成相机配置后直接运行；"
msgstr "Run it directly after completing the camera configuration in the platform;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:173
msgid "通过 HTTP API 进行调用与集成。"
msgstr "Calls and integrations via HTTP API."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:175
msgid "详情请阅读下一章 :ref:`运行工作流`"
msgstr "Please read the next chapter for details :ref:`Run Workflow`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:178
msgid "用于快速复现的工作流定义"
msgstr "Workflow definition for quick reproduction"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:180
msgid "为便于复现与分享，下面提供一份可直接复制到 UI 编辑器中的工作流定义。"
msgstr ""
"To facilitate reproduction and sharing, here is a workflow definition "
"that can be copied directly into the UI editor."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:182
msgid "Workflow Definition"
msgstr "Workflow Definition"

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:186
msgid "将Json的内容复制后，在工作流的左下角打开高级编辑器，粘贴内容并保存即可。"
msgstr ""
"After copying the Json content, open the advanced editor in the lower "
"left corner of the workflow, paste the content and save it."

#: ../../source/user_guide/create_workflow.rst:190
msgid "工作流定义"
msgstr "Workflow definition"

